webhook_status.description:
Last webhook received (UTC): {received}
Event: {event}
Polling fallback: {fallback}
Last successful poll (UTC): {poll}

1. Copy the URL below.
2. In Hospitable open Apps → Webhooks under Tools → Webhooks tab → + Add new.
3. Give it a name, paste the URL, select Reservations, and Save.
4. Click Test in Hospitable, then reopen this status screen.

Anyone with the URL can post to it, which is why signature verification matters. Keep the URL private. Only Home Assistant Cloud delivery is accepted.
